{"3895420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skewer'd", "steam_appid": 3895420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4858450], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SILLY PARTY ACTION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skewer'd is a bombastic physics based party brawler game where you fight to be the last player standing. Put on your tightest shorts, grab the nearest spear and hop into the stadium to prove to your friends once and for all that you do in fact have things going on in your life, Greg!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895420/extras/facad7a59e493b6dec90447a2c332fc9.poster.avif?t=1785790133\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895420/extras/facad7a59e493b6dec90447a2c332fc9.webm?t=1785790133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895420/extras/facad7a59e493b6dec90447a2c332fc9.mp4?t=1785790133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br><br><strong>GO FOR GOLD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, flip, smack and skewer your way to the top of the podium in a nonstop battle against your closest friends and your own crippling insecurities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895420/extras/2e35ec9de42cec949d1363b39d0d1d97.poster.avif?t=1785790133\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895420/extras/2e35ec9de42cec949d1363b39d0d1d97.webm?t=1785790133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895420/extras/2e35ec9de42cec949d1363b39d0d1d97.mp4?t=1785790133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLIMITED POWER!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and combine all sorts of wild and totally legal combat abilities to do to your friends what you could only dream of doing in real life!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895420/extras/919e1dea12f67b2c14b560e228d9596a.poster.avif?t=1785790133\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895420/extras/919e1dea12f67b2c14b560e228d9596a.webm?t=1785790133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895420/extras/919e1dea12f67b2c14b560e228d9596a.mp4?t=1785790133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONLINE AND/OR ON A COUCH!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got friends? Well isn't that nice. Play with them online or if you're like me club them and drag them into your basement to play with you forever and ever. (Waste bucket not provided)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895420/extras/07e0e0cc338e47786d42ca8ecda8bc98.poster.avif?t=1785790133\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895420/extras/07e0e0cc338e47786d42ca8ecda8bc98.webm?t=1785790133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895420/extras/07e0e0cc338e47786d42ca8ecda8bc98.mp4?t=1785790133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SILLY P